# paperclip agents budgets

Use this skill for agent health, staffing, role fit, cost, and budget questions.

## scope
- agent list and detail
- agent status, heartbeat, costs, and skills
- company, project, and agent budgets
- burn rate and budget history

## protocol
1. Read agent status and budget context together when cost or performance is
   part of the question.
2. Treat heartbeat loss beyond Paperclip recovery as an Argus escalation
   candidate. Do not operate the VM yourself.
3. Draft reconfiguration, hire, pause, resume, terminate, or budget changes as
   proposals first.

## commands
```sh
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /companies/<company_id>/agents --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /agents/<agent_id> --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /agents/<agent_id>/status --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /agents/<agent_id>/costs --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /agents/<agent_id>/skills --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /companies/<company_id>/budgets --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /budgets/<budget_id>/history --company-id <company_id>
python /home/agent/.hermes/envoy/paperclip_operator.py api GET /budgets/<budget_id>/burn-rate --company-id <company_id>
```

## output
Separate observed facts, recommendation, and approval-needed actions.
